WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.933 --> 00:00:02.201
SHIV ROY:
<i> Dad's in a secret meeting,</i>

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.436
and I'm in here
with a coloring book.

00:00:04.803 --> 00:00:06.272
What's going on, Gerri?

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:07.874
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:09.008
LOGAN ROY:<i> I want Pierce,</i>

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:10.809
<i> but it only works
 if we meet fast.</i>

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.144
KENDALL ROY:<i> Rhea, she's coming.</i>

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:13.946
The family trusts her,
you get her on board,

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.014
<i> that's huge.</i>

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:18.485
On behalf of the Pierce family,
I have a message.

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.319
What's that?

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:22.055
-What, what?
-Sir, please follow me, yeah.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:23.123
Excuse me, excuse me.

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.392
Wait, where's Kendall,
is he safe?

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.529
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

